    "q-236831": {
      "dom_id": "step-q236831",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "$9-35=${{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "Since $35$ is larger than $9,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n35-9\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,15\\end{aligned} \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\\,\\,9\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n35-9=26.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n9-35=-26.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
