    "q-6102": {
      "dom_id": "step-q6102",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "$100-212=$",
      "worked_solution": "Since $212$ is larger than $100,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n212-100\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n212-100=112.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n100-212=-112\n$$",
